  "_about": "The R and Python cheat sheet at /resources/r-python/ (Jones, 2026-10-12: keep both languages for IE 3301, with a one-page cheat sheet). Each row's r and py are shown on the page. A row with `check` is run in both languages by notebooks/check_rpython.py, which fails if the two numbers differ; `check` holds the expression to compare when the shown code does not itself return one number. Rows marked random are run but not compared, because the two languages' random numbers differ even with the same seed. The data the checks use is in `preamble`.",
